OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews praised for
OL,4,Aexplosion-risk ship response
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire service chief said preparing for
OL,7,Fmajor incidents would remain a "focus",
OL,8,Fafter a review praised its response to
OL,9,Fa ship carrying a potentially explosive
OL,10,Fcargo docking in the county.
OL,12,FHis Majesty's Inspectorate of
OL,13,FConstabulary and Fire & Rescue Services
OL,14,F(HMICFRS) found Norfolk Fire and Rescue
OL,15,FService had improved in 16 problem
OL,16,Fareas since its last inspection in
OL,17,F2023.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
