OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews praised for
OL,4,Aexplosion-risk ship response
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe watchdog rated it "good" overall
OL,7,Fand investigators said it "responded
OL,8,Fwell" to the damaged MV Ruby docking at
OL,9,FGreat Yarmouth port in 2024, amid fears
OL,10,Fits cargo of fertiliser could explode.
OL,12,FHowever, it did find the service's
OL,13,Fpreparedness for major incidents
OL,14,Frequired improvement.
